# Environment for the MCP Worker (mcp.snapforgelab.com).
# Local: copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) for `npx wrangler dev`.
# Production: set each value with `npx wrangler secret put NAME` or in the
# Cloudflare dashboard (Worker -> Settings -> Variables and Secrets). Never commit real values.

# Public verification token from the OpenAI Apps portal, served at /.well-known/openai-apps-challenge.
# Optional: the route returns an empty body when unset.
OPENAI_APPS_CHALLENGE=

# Bindings are declared in wrangler.toml, not here:
#   RATE_KV  KV namespace for per-IP rate limits (check_app 20/h, /scan-deep 5/h)
